{"action":"opened","number":5427,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gammapy/gammapy/pulls/5427","id":2064029782,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAJm2KM57BphW","html_url":"https://github.com/gammapy/gammapy/pull/5427","diff_url":"https://github.com/gammapy/gammapy/pull/5427.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gammapy/gammapy/pull/5427.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gammapy/gammapy/issues/5427","number":5427,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"A time resolved spectroscopy estimator","user":{"login":"AtreyeeS","id":32677370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjc3Mzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32677370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS","html_url":"https://github.com/AtreyeeS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AtreyeeS/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"body":"As mentioned by @cgalelli  in the last dev call, there is a necessity for a Time resolved spectroscopy estimator.
After internal discussions, we think having the output as a `FluxMaps` container is more cumbersome.

This PR is a first sketch of such an estimator.
